ponsor recipient that received the prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:176:    /// @param prizeToken ERC-721 contract of the returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:177:    /// @param prizeTokenId Token ID of the returned prize.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:179:        address indexed caller, address indexed recipient, address indexed prizeToken, uint256 prizeTokenId\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:184:    /// @notice Raised when a caller other than the immutable factory attempts clone initialization.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:197:    /// @notice Raised when an ERC-721 receiver callback does not exactly match the configured factory prize deposit.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:198:    /// @param token ERC-721 contract that invoked the receiver callback.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:260:    /// @notice Raised when no current sponsor proceeds remain claimable.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:292:    /// @notice Raised when the sponsor prize cannot be returned in the current result state.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:296:    /// @notice Raised when the escrowed prize has already been released.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:299:    /// @notice Raised when the prize token does not report the expected owner after transfer.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:300:    /// @param recipient Address that should own the prize after delivery.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:306:    /// @dev Callable exactly once and only by the immutable canonical factory. Prize escrow activates the raffle later.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:307:    /// @param params Clone-specific sponsor, prize, accounting, identifier, reserve, and timing configuration.\npackages/contracts/src/interfaces/IRaffle.sol:311:    /// @param recipient Address that receives the newly minted ERC-721 